direction(3,'Finite étale multisections and the nonprojective obstruction',4,4,[16,17],[6,7],'An exact corrected version of7.4 and an identified example for the adjacent nonprojective warning.','Published EGA17.16 supplies quasi-finite covers, while the manuscript’s construction uses projectivity.','Trace the manuscript’s7.5 bibliographic hints and compare one explicit proper nonprojective family with the finite-cover requirement.')
