direction(8,'Linear systems over imperfect fields and rational members',3,4,[70,74,75],[46,49,50],'An exact statement of determination by rational members with the required scalar-unit and descent assumptions.','Proper geometrically integral k-linear section spaces are recovered; the wider imperfect-field formulation is not identified.','Transcribe the live hypotheses of4.4 into a single proposition and test whether every represented divisor has a k-rational section line.')
